# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# FIN-001 Automatic Transaction Categorization
#
# WHY THIS FILE MATTERS
# The raw dataset is openly downloadable from Hugging Face (see data/README.md and
# scripts/download_data.py), so the repository documents where to get it instead of
# carrying data blobs in Git history. The deployed model bundle IS committed on purpose
# (Streamlit Community Cloud deploys from GitHub and the app cannot start without it).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Raw and processed data: never committed -------------------------------
data/raw/
data/processed/
data/interim/
data/_rejected_placeholder/
data/*.csv
data/*.parquet
data/*.zip
# ...but the provenance documentation must stay tracked:
!data/README.md

# --- Local agent instructions (course rule: CLAUDE.md is local-only) -------
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

# --- Python environments and caches ----------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Experiment tracking and model binaries --------------------------------
mlruns/
mlartifacts/
artifacts/*.pkl
artifacts/*.pt
artifacts/*.pth
artifacts/*.onnx
artifacts/*.bin
# ...but keep the artifact documentation and any small schema/config files:
!artifacts/README.md
!artifacts/*.json

# The model bundle IS committed on purpose so the deployed app can start.
!artifacts/transaction_categorizer.joblib

# MLflow local tracking database (regenerate with: python -m src.experiments)
mlflow.db

# --- Secrets ----------------------------------------------------------------
.env
*.env
secrets.*
*.key
*.pem

# --- Editors and OS ---------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Local scratch ----------------------------------------------------------
scratch/
tmp/
*.log

# --- Course pack files that are not part of the deliverable ----------------
EXTC2_STUDENT_SHOWCASE_PACK/
EXTC2_STUDENT_SHOWCASE_PACK.rar
Claude_Code_Module8_Capstone_Workflow_Guide_UPDATED.docx
EXTC4_*
